    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "taking control of my own silence... that sounds almost impossible. there's no way out. even if i just went away for a weekend i'd still be thinking about everything that needs doing. like i'm tethered to this life by a thousand strings and i can't just cut them. it feels like the only way to actually get some peace would be to just... stop. completely.",
